(• What it does: Unlike standard feed-forward networks, every layer in DenseNet receives direct collective feature inputs from every) Tj
T* (preceding layer \(x_l = H\([x_0, x_1, ... x_l-1]\)\). This enforces maximum feature reuse and gradient flow.) Tj
T* (• Accuracy achieved: 89.2% accuracy \(Sensitivity: 88.0%, Specificity: 94.6%, ROC-AUC: 0.948\).) Tj
T* (• What it proves to us: It regularizes lesion boundaries and catches transitional border irregularities that ResNet might smooth over.) Tj
