(• What it does: It uses MBConv inverted bottleneck blocks with Squeeze-and-Excitation channel attention, uniformly scaling network depth,) Tj
T* (width, and resolution using a compound coefficient.) Tj
T* (• Accuracy achieved: 91.5% accuracy \(Sensitivity: 89.9%, Specificity: 96.2%, ROC-AUC: 0.963\).) Tj
T* (• What it proves to us: It is our most accurate standalone model, highly sensitive to subtle vascular patterns \(arborizing telangiectasia\) and) Tj
T* (micro-pigment globules.) Tj
