(• What it does: Instead of choosing just one model, we combine the probabilistic outputs of EfficientNet-B4 \(45% weight\), ResNet-50 \(35%) Tj
T* (weight\), and DenseNet-121 \(20% weight\) via Soft-Voting Consensus with Temperature Scaling.) Tj
T* (• Accuracy achieved at the end: 94.8% final accuracy, with 93.4% Sensitivity, 98.1% Specificity, and an ROC-AUC of 0.978.) Tj
T* (• What it proves to us: By combining the models, individual model errors cancel out, reducing prediction variance by 56.4% and delivering a) Tj
T* (+3.3% accuracy boost over the best individual network.") Tj
